OL,3,GNEWSAResidents forced from homes in
OL,4,AOmagh security alert
OL,5,
OL,6,FA number of people are being moved from
OL,7,Ftheir homes due to a security alert in
OL,8,FOmagh, County Tyrone.
OL,10,FPolice have confirmed they are at the
OL,11,Fscene of the alert in Gardenville
OL,12,FAvenue.
OL,14,FThey said cordons are in place.
OL,16,FPolice have asked the public to avoid
OL,17,Fthe area at this time.
